site_name
CookieRun: Classic/FanWiki
-----
site_description
Wiki and build planner for CookieRun: Classic cookies, pets, and treasures — grades, combo bonuses, effects, and score builds.
-----
index_page_description
CookieRun: Classic fan wiki: cookies, pets, treasures, combo bonuses, and community score builds in one place.
-----
cookies_page_description
Browse all CookieRun: Classic cookies with grades, Power+ effects, unlock goals, and pet combo bonuses.
-----
pets_page_description
Browse all CookieRun: Classic pets with grades, unlock goals, and cookie combo bonuses.
-----
treasures_page_description
Browse all CookieRun: Classic treasures with effects, evolved variants, and blessed upgrades.
-----
builds_page_description
Community CookieRun: Classic builds: cookie, pet, and treasure loadouts with EP, boosts, and run results.
-----
entity_detail_description
{name}: stats, effects, combo bonuses, and linked treasures on the CookieRun: Classic fan wiki.
